// The connector rules, the rules.flecs of the original's auto tiling: a WallSegment joins two
// walls on orthogonally neighboring tiles, on the middle of their shared edge, turned by PI / 2
// between two walls of one column. OreConnectorSync places and removes the connectors as walls
// are placed and removed; they are purely visual (no health, not in the grid, not a target).

using oreelse

rules {
  wall_segment {
    OreConnectRule: {left: [Wall], right: [Wall], out: WallSegment, rotate: true}
  }
}
